.TH geectl-request-file-change-devel 1  "geectl-request-file-change-devel 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-request\-file\-change\-devel \- File a change\-devel request: change a package\*(Aqs devel project
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl request file\-change\-devel\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-source\-project\fR> <\fB\-\-source\-package\fR> <\fB\-\-target\-project\fR> <\fB\-\-target\-package\fR> <\fB\-\-description\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
File a change\-devel request: change a package\*(Aqs devel project
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-source\-project\fR \fI<SOURCE_PROJECT>\fR
The project the package lives in
.TP
\fB\-\-source\-package\fR \fI<SOURCE_PACKAGE>\fR
The package whose devel project changes
.TP
\fB\-\-target\-project\fR \fI<TARGET_PROJECT>\fR
The project that becomes the devel project
.TP
\fB\-\-target\-package\fR \fI<TARGET_PACKAGE>\fR
The package in the devel project
.TP
\fB\-\-description\fR \fI<DESCRIPTION>\fR
The request description. Values starting with `\-` are taken literally: a description may open with a `\- ` bullet
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
